<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
    <PropertyGroup>
        <TargetFrameworks>net461;netstandard2.0;net6.0</TargetFrameworks>        
        <Version>1.0.0-Beta-02</Version>
        <InformationalVersion>1.0.0</InformationalVersion>
        <PackageReleaseNotes>Integrate new BetList for ASKMESLOT(#216974)</PackageReleaseNotes>
        <Description>
            New bet list for ASKEMSLOT

            For ASKEMSLOT RNG: The result link should call this Javascript function: "showASKMESLOTBetDetails(transId, 'winlostDate', custId, transactionType);"

            Which transactionType is:

            - 1, if the status is Won, Lose, Draw, or Refund

            - 2, if the status is Reject, or Void

            - 3, if the status is Running, or Waiting

            - otherwise, 0</Description>
